## Advertising (Q2+)

- Full lecture + Workspace menus: `quarters/Q2/advertising-background.md`
- Name ad → select ≤**9** benefits → **rank** visibility → emphasize a **brand** (or company) → preview print **and** web
- Tip: ≥**2** test-market ads (primary + secondary; optional company ad); design/modify has a cost
- Match claims to bike specs (Hike Bike: no lights/reflectors; mountain tires / steep-trail / adventure OK; avoid comfort-seat & Speed cues)
- Media prefs: `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Media_Preference** — Mountain: Biking → Sport → General News (Leisure = Rec)
- Organic SEM: `quarters/Q2/seo-internet-marketing-background.md` · `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Web_SEO** — convert ads→pages; segment picks keywords; SERP shows **first 3 benefits only**; organic is slow; no deceptive claims
- Compensation: `quarters/Q2/compensation-background.md` · `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Comp_Industry** — interactive pay vs **~70%** productivity; early importance Salary→Health→Vacation→Pension; Q3 gets prior-q industry averages; **packages OPEN**
- Sales channel: `quarters/Q2/sales-channel-background.md` · `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Sales_Ops** — per-location Total + Service/Rec/Mountain/Speed training; **Regional Summary** (Prior/Current/Net · Hire/Layoff/Salary+Training); test tip ≤**7**/city, ≥**1** service; city #2; web tactics; demand bridge; **OPEN**
- Web productivity: `quarters/Q2/web-productivity-background.md` · `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Web_Productivity** — toll-free (setup/budget $3k) vs page upgrades ($6k); diminishing returns (most gain by ~$10k); toll-free >> pages on %; Start/Stop **OPEN**
- Demand projection: `quarters/Q2/demand-projection-background.md` · `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Demand_Forecast** — units/SP × people (stores+web); brand split; Q2 tip **~40**/SP; Q3 tip **~60**/SP; stock-out ill-will = ½ unmet %; **OPEN**
- Operating capacity: `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Manufacturing** (B39) — fixed **24**/1,560; productivity **70%**; labor U-curve (best ~18–22/day; rises at 24); OH flats ~$45–50; **OPEN**
- Overtime / production sim: Manufacturing OT table (prod 70%→64.4% at 4h) · `Q2Data.xlsx` → **Production_Sim** — stockouts, utilization, excess capacity, printer add; **OPEN**
- Goal: **match top ads** · **pay > average**; media/web/comp/sales/demand/OC not locked unless team directs

## Agent norms

- Prefer in-sim data over external tips; external = advisory
- Log only agreed decisions in `quarters/QX/decisions.md`
- Ask for survey exports rather than inventing numbers
- Do not invent needs/WTP/potential scores or lock ads/prices without explicit team direction
